{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"displayed-category","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"Displayed Category"}]},"title_text":"Displayed Category","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"displayed-category.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","displayed-category"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"A "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"displayed category"}]},{"Text":" "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(cal(D))"}},{"Text":" over a "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"category","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"base category"}]}},{"Text":" "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" packages the data of a category that “lies over” "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":": each object and each morphism of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" is equipped with a fiber of objects and morphisms displayed atop it. It consists of"}]},{"Enum":{"numbering":null,"start":1,"tight":true,"items":[{"number":null,"body":{"Inline":[{"Text":"For each object "},{"Math":{"src":"x : cal(C)_0"}},{"Text":", a "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"type"}]},{"Text":" of displayed objects "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(cal(D))_x"}},{"Text":" lying over "},{"Math":{"src":"x"}},{"Text":". We write "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(x) : overline(cal(D))_x"}},{"Text":" for a displayed object over "},{"Math":{"src":"x"}},{"Text":"."}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Inline":[{"Text":"For each morphism "},{"Math":{"src":"f : cal(C) (x, y)"}},{"Text":" and displayed objects "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(x) : overline(cal(D))_x"}},{"Text":" and "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(y) : overline(cal(D))_y"}},{"Text":", a "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"set"}]},{"Text":" of displayed morphisms "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(cal(D))_f (overline(x), overline(y))"}},{"Text":" lying over "},{"Math":{"src":"f"}},{"Text":". We write such a displayed morphism "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(g) : overline(cal(D))_f (overline(x), overline(y))"}},{"Text":" as "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(g) : overline(x) scripts(->)_f overline(y)"}},{"Text":" or "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(x) limits(scripts(->)_f)^(overline(g)) overline(y)"}},{"Text":", subscripting the arrow with the base morphism "},{"Math":{"src":"f"}},{"Text":" it lies over."}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Inline":[{"Text":"A displayed composition operation. For "},{"Math":{"src":"f : x -> y"}},{"Text":" and "},{"Math":{"src":"g : y -> z"}},{"Text":" with displayed morphisms "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(f) : overline(x) scripts(->)_f overline(y)"}},{"Text":" and "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(g) : overline(y) scripts(->)_g overline(z)"}},{"Text":", there is a displayed morphism "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(f) ⋆ overline(g) : overline(cal(D))_(f ⋆ g) (overline(x), overline(z))"}},{"Text":" lying over the composite "},{"Math":{"src":"f ⋆ g"}},{"Text":"."}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Inline":[{"Text":"For each "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(x) : overline(cal(D))_x"}},{"Text":", a displayed identity "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"id\")_(overline(x)) : overline(cal(D))_(sans(\"id\")_x) (overline(x), overline(x))"}},{"Text":" lying over "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"id\")_x"}},{"Text":"."}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Left-unitality, displayed: for all "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(f) : overline(cal(D))_f (overline(x), overline(y))"}},{"Text":", a heterogeneous equality"}]},{"Math":{"src":"overline(sans(\"idL\")_f) : sans(\"id\")_(overline(x)) ⋆ overline(f) scripts(=)_(sans(\"idL\")_f) overline(f)"}}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Right-unitality, displayed: for all "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(f) : overline(cal(D))_f (overline(x), overline(y))"}},{"Text":", a heterogeneous equality"}]},{"Math":{"src":"overline(sans(\"idR\")_f) : overline(f) ⋆ sans(\"id\")_(overline(y)) scripts(=)_(sans(\"idR\")_f) overline(f)"}}]}},{"number":null,"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Associativity, displayed: for all "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(f)"}},{"Text":", "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(g)"}},{"Text":", "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(h)"}},{"Text":" over "},{"Math":{"src":"f : x -> y"}},{"Text":", "},{"Math":{"src":"g : y -> z"}},{"Text":", "},{"Math":{"src":"h : z -> w"}},{"Text":", a heterogeneous equality"}]},{"Math":{"src":"overline(sans(\"assoc\")_(f, g, h)) : (overline(f) ⋆ overline(g)) ⋆ overline(h) scripts(=)_(sans(\"assoc\")_(f, g, h)) overline(f) ⋆ (overline(g) ⋆ overline(h))"}}]}}]}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Because the type "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(cal(D))_f (overline(x), overline(y))"}},{"Text":" of displayed morphisms depends on the base morphism "},{"Math":{"src":"f"}},{"Text":", the two sides of each displayed law inhabit "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"different"}]},{"Text":" displayed hom-sets — those indexed by the two sides of the corresponding base-category equation. Each displayed law is therefore a "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"heterogeneous equality"}]},{"Text":" "},{"Math":{"src":"a scripts(=)_p b"}},{"Text":": a path from "},{"Math":{"src":"a"}},{"Text":" to "},{"Math":{"src":"b"}},{"Text":" lying over the base path "},{"Math":{"src":"p"}},{"Text":", rather than an equation within a single fixed set."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Concretely, this definition models "},{"Link":{"url":"https://github.com/agda/cubical/blob/master/Cubical/Categories/Displayed/Base.agda","body":[{"Text":"the one used in the Cubical standard library"}]}},{"Text":" "},{"Cite":{"key":"cubicalagdalib","supplement":null,"rendered":"[1]"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"A displayed category is to a category as a dependent type is to a context. In this way, displayed categories are effectively "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"dependent categories"}]},{"Text":", as we present the structure of "},{"Math":{"src":"overline(cal(D))"}},{"Text":" as a category parametrized by the structure of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Displayed categories were introduced by Ahrens and Lumsdaine "},{"Cite":{"key":"ahrens-lumsdaine-2019","supplement":null,"rendered":"[2]"}},{"Text":". The point is that a displayed category over "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" is equivalent to the data of a category "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(D)"}},{"Text":" together with a functor "},{"Math":{"src":"F : cal(D) -> cal(C)"}},{"Text":", but presented as families indexed by the objects and morphisms of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" — so that constructions like Grothendieck fibrations can be defined without ever invoking equality of objects."}]}]}}}]}}
